false,"text":"それゆえ、同じ失敗を何度も繰り返してしまうことも。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17776","sourceWorkId":"29330","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく面倒見が良く積極的で、同僚や患者達からも信頼されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、少し猪突猛進な面があり、たまに失敗をする事もしばしば・・・・。赴任してきた主人公に一目惚れしてしまい、積極的にアプローチしてくる。しかし、その裏では恋に対して劣等感を抱いており、常に意識している。産婦人科のナースで『七瀬　恋』の父親違いの妹。母親は同じ。恋の父親と別れた1年後に、母親は愛を生んでいる。母親がナースだった事もあり、愛もその影響でナースの道に入った。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92146"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17776","sourceWorkId":"7979","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17776","sourceWorkId":"7979","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17776","sourceWorkId":"7979","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17776","sourceWorkId":"7979","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"45 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17776","sourceWorkId":"7979","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f0cd00e4aa52c7a90de56d058391fb178502d1e2eef707e7b3df7311e70b2a86.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/17eff873b28a0b78d4c98c5c60e71f358f7cf0004d3355168e9104003016b8eb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"本井えみ","creatorId":"vndb:s124","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s124","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s124","name":"本井 えみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:77574:92146:4177:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c30486","characterName":"伊佐美 鈴花","sour